# Docker 构建上下文排除清单（服务端镜像用）
# 构建本身只需要: go.mod, go.sum, cmd/, internal/, configs/, web/(源码), deploy/

.git
temp
.zcode
docs

# 前端在镜像里重新构建，本地产物一律不带
web/node_modules
web/dist
internal/server/ui/dist

# 本地产物与数据
bin
build
data
itagent-deploy
itagent-pkg
agent_install_pkg

# 运行时数据与真实配置绝不能进构建上下文（DB 快照 176M+ 会拖慢构建；
# configs/server.json 含真实 install_token/admin_token，镜像内已有模板、运行时由 compose 挂载覆盖）
deploy/server/mysql-data
deploy/server/data
deploy/server/configs

# 打包产物与本机工具
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.exe
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log
